WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:21.789
"Look!" Dipper said.

2
00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:25.505
"There's a picture in the box."

3
00:00:25.505 --> 00:00:28.679
The picture showed a road.

4
00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:36.007
An X was next to it.

5
00:00:36.008 --> 00:00:38.668
"Oh!" Eddy said.

6
00:00:38.669 --> 00:00:42.866
"We're going to drive off-road." "How

7
00:00:42.866 --> 00:00:46.197
do you know?" Jeb said. "See

8
00:00:46.198 --> 00:00:49.336
the X ?" Eddy said.

9
00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:53.911
"It is off the road."

10
00:00:53.912 --> 00:00:57.578
"You're smart, Eddy," Poppy said.

11
00:00:57.579 --> 00:01:02.184
"So where do we go?" Gasser asked.

12
00:01:02.184 --> 00:01:05.605
"Where can we drive off-road?"

13
00:01:05.606 --> 00:01:10.142
"In the woods," Eddy said.

14
00:01:10.142 --> 00:01:26.479
"Follow me!"

15
00:01:26.479 --> 00:01:44.103
Everyone drove along the trail.

16
00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:48.205
They came to a stop sign.

17
00:01:48.205 --> 00:01:51.508
Eddy looked around.

18
00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:57.681
He didn't see any clues. Honk!

19
00:01:57.682 --> 00:02:01.527
Poppy honked the horn. Suddenly—

20
00:02:01.528 --> 00:02:04.358
Honk, honk!

21
00:02:04.358 --> 00:02:13.681
Someone honked back!

22
00:02:13.681 --> 00:02:20.218
"It's Mr. Grill!" Dipper cried.

23
00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:24.179
"Good job, everyone," Mr. Grill said.

24
00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:32.117
"You found me!"

